                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Cascade cost check",
              "text": "==escalation rate × large cost + small cost < always-large cost==, or routing loses money"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Streaming",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==SSE== sends tokens as generated",
                "Total time is the same; ==TTFT drops==, so the UI feels fast",
                "Tool-call args arrive as {red:partial JSON}: buffer until the block ends, then parse",
                "Mid-stream error or client disconnect: **cancel** the upstream call"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "Interview Point",
              "items": [
                "**When does a cascade lose money?** When escalations push total cost above always-large.",
                "**Does streaming cut latency?** Only TTFT, not total time."
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
